# SNAPSHOT — tnls (SSH tunnel manager)

Last updated: 2026-10-10 (Phase 2: ProxyJump + remote port fix)
Status: Phase 2 model done — verify xong, chuẩn bị import/export
Current phase: Phase 2 (2/6 features)
Toolchain: rustc 1.96.0 MSVC 14.29 (VS2019, override pinned for repo), Node v24.14.0, OpenSSH_for_Windows_9.5p1

## Product

Desktop app (Tauri 2 + React + Rust) quản lý SSH tunnels: lưu profiles,
bật/tắt bằng UI, chạy nền qua system tray, không cần terminal mỗi tunnel.

## Architecture (chốt)

Tauri 2 / React+TS+Vite / Rust+Tokio / OpenSSH process / SQLite /
tracing / GitHub Actions. Xem chi tiết: docs/DESIGN.md.

